    - [/] Formatter {estimate: 3d, started: 2026-10-15T00:00Z} ^rhumb-fmt
    - [ ] Can edges carry notes? {kind: question, estimate: 4h} ^edge-notes
  - [/] Web view {star: true} ^ui
